Feature: Scoped curated usage knowledge
  Knowledge proposes routing and observations; program checkers retain authority.

  @atdd-usage-knowledge
  Scenario: Apply scoped curated advice, retain private feedback, and replan from observations
    Given a public example and explicitly loaded external knowledge layers
    When a configured loop consults the current scoped records
    Then unknown dimensions do not satisfy required conditions
    And numeric comparisons retain their integer and unit boundaries
    And inheritance preserves every other scope condition
    And unvalidated or stale replacements do not retire accepted records
    And overlapping conflicts and unevidenced records fail integrity checks
    And every derived answer has a replayable finite explanation
    And evidenced blockers filter optional program stages
    And actual outputs determine the next proposed step
    And one proposed observation is written to a private inbox
    And ordinary diagnostics and receipts contain no knowledge facts
    And MCP knowledge tools are read only
    And disabled scope, conflict, evidence and provenance checks fail their controls
